{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24336","headline":"秋霖中奉裴令公见招早出赴会马上先寄六韵 · 白居易","name":"秋霖中奉裴令公见招早出赴会马上先寄六韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雨暗三秋日，泥深一尺时。\n老人平旦出，自问欲何之。\n不是寻医药，非干送别离。\n素书传好语，绦帐赴佳期。\n续借桃花马，催迎杨柳姬。\n只愁张录事，罚我怪来迟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24336.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24336","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}